code) are written into SCREEN-CONTROL-PLAN.md sections 1.2/1.3/10 rather than
duplicated here - that document is the one to read for the design
consequences, this entry is the log of what was run and when.

DELIBERATELY NOT DONE: any ddcutil setvcp (write) command. This VM's DP-1
monitor is the SAME physical monitor (matching serial 401NTMX52747) already
probed read-only on the dev host at the very start of this work, under the
explicit constraint to stay read-only and never change the user's own
